  "notes": {
    "migration": "OpenAI removes these models from the API on 2026-05-12: dall-e-2, dall-e-3. Calls that name them fail after that date. Recommended replacements: dall-e-2 to gpt-image-2, gpt-image-1, or gpt-image-1-mini; dall-e-3 to gpt-image-2, gpt-image-1, or gpt-image-1-mini. A newer model can answer differently, so test the switch rather than only renaming.",
    "edgeCases": [
      "A model name read from an environment variable, a config file or a variable set elsewhere is not found.",
      "A mocked API response that names the model, such as an msw or nock handler for the endpoint, is reported too.",
      "Azure OpenAI calls are reported too, though Azure names deployments its own way and sets its own retirement dates."
    ]
  },
